# Build outputs of the video pipeline. None of this belongs in a deployment,
# and uploading it is not merely wasteful: `out/.render-tmp` holds a live
# Chromium profile while `pnpm video` is running, and a deploy that walks into
# it fails with a file lock rather than anything that reads like the real cause.
#
# The narration mp3s the site actually serves live in `public/narration/` and
# are NOT covered by this.
out
vendor
